'''Trickster Himeyuri''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Update 6.0]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]] reduces time between attacks, increases health, attack power and [[Slow|slow]] duration. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

