==Trivia==
*It is possibly implied in his description that she is possessing [[Imagawa Yoshimoto (Uber Rare Cat)|Imagawa Yoshimoto]], as she is a Ninetails, and Yoshimoto's description says he is "possessed by an all-knowing fox spirit". Furthermore, Himeyuri's first form says that she "wanders mortal realms hunting for the weak-willed", and these two Cats are the only ones that reference Kitsune lore. In Japanese folklore, she would be considered a [[wikipedia:Kitsune|Kitsune]] or, more specifically, a Nogitsune, as she does not actively harbor hatred against humans or Cats in her other forms.

